## Branch Naming

| Scenario | Pattern | Example |
|----------|---------|---------|
| With issue ID | `<issue-id>-<session>` | `VFM-1234-phase1` |
| Without issue ID | `feature/<trd-name>/<session>` | `feature/user-auth/api` |
| Hotfix | `hotfix/<issue-id>` | `hotfix/VFM-1235` |

