## Quality Gates

Before completing any implementation task:

- [ ] Tests pass (unit >= {{UNIT_COVERAGE}}%, integration >= {{INTEGRATION_COVERAGE}}%)
- [ ] No secrets in code
- [ ] Input validation present
- [ ] Documentation updated

